    "faq": {
      "type": "mt-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need to use every component of the recommended care plan?",
            "answer": "<p>The components may serve different purposes, so do not assume that using one product alone will provide the same approach. Follow the care plan recommended for you and the approved instructions supplied with each product. If you are unsure what to use, ask a MARCEL OSMF Consultant before changing the plan.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How soon will I notice a result?",
            "answer": "<p>There is no single timeline that applies to everyone. Burning, eating comfort and mouth opening are different outcomes and may change at different rates. Follow the recommended care plan and arrange a review if progress is not as expected.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What should I do if my symptoms are not improving?",
            "answer": "<p>Do not increase the amount or frequency of a product on your own. Note changes in burning, eating comfort and mouth opening, then contact a MARCEL OSMF Consultant for a review. If symptoms worsen or you notice an ulcer, lump, bleeding or another unusual change, arrange an in-person assessment promptly.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What should I do if I experience strong burning, swelling or sores after using a product?",
            "answer": "<p>If you experience a strong or worsening reaction, stop using the product until you have received medical advice and contact a MARCEL OSMF Consultant. Seek urgent care for difficulty breathing, marked swelling or another severe reaction. Keep the product pack available so the clinician can review what you used.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use MARCEL OMR Therapy™ while receiving treatment from another doctor?",
            "answer": "<p>Tell a MARCEL OSMF Consultant or your treating doctor about the medicines, procedures and oral products you are currently using. Do not stop or change prescribed treatment on your own. They can help you decide whether the approaches can be used together and whether an in-person assessment is needed.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
